{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bz4Lf4Tn921794353046.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>市建局土瓜灣道/榮光街發展項目，中午截標。</p><p></p><p>地盤總面積約58,900多平方呎，可興建約900個住宅單位。</p><p></p><p>有測量師表示，近期紅磡及土瓜灣新盤銷情理想，反映區內物業需求殷切，預期截標項目將受不少發展商歡迎。鑑於項目規模及投資較大，估計以大型發展商及財團參與為主，綜合市場估值介乎39億至48億元、即每平方呎約6,600至8,100元。</p><p></p><p>項目是全港首個「小區重建新社區」最後一個重建項目，是市建局以「小區發展」模式推行的八個項目之一。項目早前共接獲28份意向書。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:08:58.208532+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T01:23:21.170898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:02:25.608157+00:00","content_hash":"a2d91691fcfdff2e430ecba1cc976c8bb0f4b3617dccdc562832eb8a455ecfa8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:08:58.208532+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}